  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">生存岛屿生成器</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>新增一种由无数岛屿组成的世界类型！通过配置文件可调整岛屿大小、形状和分布密度。您甚至可以设置为仅生成一座孤岛，体验真正的极限生存挑战。本模组同时支持Fabric和Forge运行环境。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Discord交流群</span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/EwQmvQtshV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/EwQmvQtshV</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FZmqswFXgAAx4hE?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" alt=\"图片\" width=\"627\" height=\"332\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/817769464556290049/1047706915217621013/image.png\" width=\"628\" height=\"333\"></p>",
